><path style="fill:none" d="M 31 182.47 L 152.91 133.67"></path><g transform="matrix(0.92838 -0.37161 0.37161 0.92838 152.91 133.67)"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 3.6 0 L -2.16 2.88 L 0 0 L -2.16 -2.88"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#FF4D4D;--ltx-fill-color:#FF4D4D;--ltx-fg-color:#FF4D4D;" color="#FF4D4D" fill="#FF4D4D" stroke="#FF4D4D" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 98.79 164.45)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-fo-width:2.08em;--ltx-fo-height:0.61em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.17em;font-size:7.97pt;" color="#000000" height="8.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 6.73)" width="22.93"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S3.F2.pic1.13" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#FF4D4D;">High</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g><g stroke-width="0.8pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M -216.54 67.67 L -216.54 54.27"></path><g transform="matrix(0.0 -1.0 1.0 0.0 -216.54 54.27)"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 3.6 0 L -2.16 2.88 L 0 0 L -2.16 -2.88"></path></g></g><g stroke-width="0.8pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 76.74 L 0 54.27"></path><g transform="matrix(0.0 -1.0 1.0 0.0 0 54.27)"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 3.6 0 L -2.16 2.88 L 0 0 L -2.16 -2.88"></path></g></g><g stroke-width="0.8pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 216.54 76.74 L 216.54 54.27"></path><g transform="matrix(0.0 -1.0 1.0 0.0 216.54 54.27)"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 3.6 0 L -2.16 2.88 L 0 0 L -2.16 -2.88"></path></g></g><g stroke-width="0.8pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M -172.28 23.14 L -47.74 -9.26"></path><g transform="matrix(0.96777 -0.25182 0.25182 0.96777 -47.74 -9.26)"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 3.6 0 L -2.16 2.88 L 0 0 L -2.16 -2.88"></path></g></g><g stroke-width="0.8pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 18.62 L 0 -2.03"></path><g transform="matrix(0.0 -1.0 1.0 0.0 0 -2.03)"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 3.6 0 L -2.16 2.88 L 0 0 L -2.16 -2.88"></path></g></g><g stroke-width="0.8pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 172.28 23.14 L 47.74 -9.26"></path><g transform="matrix(-0.96777 -0.25182 0.25182 -0.96777 47.74 -9.26)"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 3.6 0 L -2.16 2.88 L 0 0 L -2.16 -2.88"></path></g></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Fig. 2: </span>Three-tier learning strategy of AgentRec showing dynamic query routing based on complexity analysis. Different tiers handle queries with varying computational requirements to optimize both response time and recommendation quality through adaptive intelligence.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="S4" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">IV </span><span id="S4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Experimental Evaluation</span></h2>

<section id="S4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="S4.SS1.4" class="ltx_text">IV-A</span> </span><span id="S4.SS1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Experimental Setup</span></h3>

<div id="S4.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We evaluate AgentRec on three real-world datasets: <span id="S4.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">DuRecDial</span> (conversational recommendation with 10,000 conversations and 156,000 utterances), <span id="S4.SS1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">DuRecDial 2.0</span> (bilingual conversations with 16,500 dialogues and 255,000 utterances), and <span id="S4.SS1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">MultiWOZ</span> (multi-domain task-oriented dialogues with 8,438 conversations adapted for recommendation tasks). We follow standard evaluation protocols for conversational recommendation systems.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="S4.SS2.4" class="ltx_text">IV-B</span> </span><span id="S4.SS2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Baseline Methods</span></h3>

<div id="S4.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We compare against several state-of-the-art approaches: <span id="S4.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Chat-REC</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">1</a>]</cite>, <span id="S4.SS2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">KBRD</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib10" title="" class="ltx_ref">10</a>]</cite>, <span id="S4.SS2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ReDial</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib5" title="" class="ltx_ref">5</a>]</cite>, <span id="S4.SS2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">KGSF</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib17" title="" class="ltx_ref">17</a>]</cite>, and <span id="S4.SS2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">UniMIND</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">18</a>]</cite>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="S4.SS3.4" class="ltx_text">IV-C</span> </span><span id="S4.SS3.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Results and Analysis</span></h3>

<div id="S4.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#S4.T1" title="TABLE I ‣ IV-C Results and Analysis ‣ IV Experimental Evaluation ‣ AgentRec: Next-Generation LLM-Powered Multi-Agent Collaborative Recommendation with Adaptive IntelligenceBeyond Chat-REC through Hierarchical Agent Networks and Real-Time Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">I</span></a> shows that AgentRec achieves consistent improvements across all datasets and metrics. Our next-generation LLM-powered framework demonstrates 2.8% improvement in conversation success rate, 1.9% enhancement in recommendation accuracy (NDCG@10), and 3.2% better conversation efficiency compared to the best baseline.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T1" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE I: </span>Performance Comparison on Conversational Recommendation Datasets</figcaption>
